# Committed production default so a prod build (Vercel) can never silently fall
# back to http://localhost:8000 when the VITE_API_URL dashboard var is missing.
# Vercel's own env var, when set, still wins (Vite does not override an existing
# build-env var with a .env file). Contains no secret: VITE_ vars ship in the
# client bundle regardless. Backend base verified live (docs/DEMO_VIDEO_SCRIPT.md).
VITE_API_URL=https://bhoomisetu-ryh4.onrender.com/api/v1
